| Whole-module `xcodebuild` compile | ✅ **0 CronParser errors** |

**⚠️ BLOCKED on the full `build test` gate (EXIT=65), for reasons external to this artifact:**
1. **Pre-existing collisions** — predecessor surfaces `RecentDrivesListWidget`/`RecentDrivesSection` and `StateTimelineWidget`/`StateTimeline` each declare the same public types in the shared module (216 iOS errors, **0 in CronParser**; `RecentDrivesSection` committed at `afff462c1` before this work).
2. **macOS signing** — runner has no development certificate (`DEVELOPMENT_TEAM=""`), failing before compilation.

Both are outside this artifact's allowed files (`CronParser.*` only) and aren't capability gaps. Per the Honesty Covenant (rule 1 *no red-as-green*, rule 8 *no commit on red*), I reported **STATUS=BLOCKED** in the gate log (`.github/prompts/monorepo/logs/p4-apple-feature-views-0014-CronParser.log`) and **withheld the commit**; the 7 verified files remain staged in the working tree for integration once the external blockers clear.

